# Example: test_sigil.wcn

## Schema

```
Car = :Engine String/model
Engine = Int/cylinders
```

## Construction

```
[:Car 
  [:Engine 4]
  "Toyota"
]
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var car = CarAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(car.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
